note contract 5 fresh, line 122: element 0 written in both arms of if/else is in the intersection at
note the join: accepted. stdout 11 then 22 (oracle exp/f5-ifelse.out).
om2
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh c ulong to ulong
if eq c 1
put s 0 11
else
put s 0 22
end
ret ulong get s 0
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 0
putd f a 1
putd f a 2
ret 0
end
